  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 169
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 修士间的对决，体内五行灵气的数量最为重要。如果你体内的灵气已经不足以释放法术了，就只能先{color=red}结束回合{/color}，再重新吸收天地灵气。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 2
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114817008595078492
